  <p id="c-chenshu-011-yuanjing-zhang-zhaoda:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-011-yuanjing-zhang-zhaoda:p001:m0000" ref="zf4_z2k_9s8_AA">章昭達</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-011-yuanjing-zhang-zhaoda:p001:m0004" ref="zf4_z2k_9s8_AA">伯通</persName>，吳興武康人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-011-yuanjing-zhang-zhaoda:p001:m0015" ref="zf4_z2k_9s8">道蓋</persName>，齊廣平太守。父<persName id="c-chenshu-011-yuanjing-zhang-zhaoda:p001:m0025" ref="zf4_z2k_9s8_A">法尚</persName>，梁揚州議曹從事。</p>
